# Training Studio (TR-00)

Full text: `docs/spec-references/TR-00-INDEX.md`. Contracts: `SPEC-training-studio-sidebar.md`, `SPEC-TRAINING-MODEL-CATALOG.md`, `SPEC-TRAINING-STUDIO-SUBCATEGORIES.md`, `SPEC-open-weight-models-in-pipeline.md`. On-demand rules: `training-studio-sidebar`, `training-model-catalog`, `training-studio-subcategories`, `open-weight-models`.

A TR is the only permission to change training-studio or open-weight-pool code. Feed one TR per session. TR-01 through TR-06 are not started from this index. `spec-reconciliation-overlay.md` still wins on conflict. This queue does not replace build-0 through build-6, BP-01 through BP-13, MP-01 through MP-15, OR-01 through OR-06, or WF-01 through WF-03, and it does not lift `GENERATION_PAUSED`.

## Order

Build after MP-01..12 works. TR-01 trainer + LoRA-inference registry. TR-02 train pipeline (zip → fal.storage → gated trainer → queue/webhook → store LoRA). TR-03 asset entities + LoRA inference wiring. TR-04 sidebar UI. TR-05 genre presets + import + rights. TR-06 open-weight bases in the selectable pool (BASE + LoRA-applied).

## Every TR inherits

1. Every trainer and LoRA-inference call is a gated paid FAL call (`submitToFal` / `providerSubmit`), pause-aware, with `source` and cost shown + confirmed.
2. Training CONTENT is the user's. Do not repurpose footage, faces, or voices. Honour deletion. Outcome data (aggregate, anonymised) may feed the orchestrator.
3. Verify every endpoint with the free OpenAPI fetch, then `https://fal.ai/models/<id>/llms.txt`, before any registry string is written. Schema wins over the catalog.
4. Additive `migrate deploy` only. Never `migrate dev`. Never reset.
5. H3 Max, Seedance 2.5, and Kling 2.6 stay evaluate-only until a fed prompt adopts them. Gemini Omni Flash 1.1 is wired (MP-14); Omni Audio and Omni Character FAL ids 404 and stay unwired. Wan 3.0 stays out of the default council until a fed prompt adopts it. HappyHorse stays out of the council until one clean generation.
6. Manual model choice is never silently replaced. Native audio stays off where the field exists except Grok.
7. ElevenLabs TTS, dialogue, clone (`clone-voice`), SFX, music, dubbing, voice-changer, STT, isolation, and forced-alignment are on FAL. Voice design FAL ids 404 and stay unwired.

On a paid-API task, run `node scripts/check-chokepoints.mjs` and report it. Do not touch files outside the fed prompt.
